{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is Java backend engineering, focusing on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. Explicitly NOT interested in training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking lists.\n\nI need to select exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set of 120.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles following patterns like:\n- Topic (事务传播/缓存失效/任务取消/线程池排队/连接池等待/接口幂等/慢查询/组合索引/并发更新/消息重复) + Context (内容管理接口/社区服务/消息消费者/后台处理任务) + Content type (专题观察/操作记录/概念速览/条件与原理/市场观察)\n\nThe content types include:\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation - community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture)\n- 操作记录 (operation records - minimal reproduction, logs, debugging)\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles)\n- 市场观察 (market observation - training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings)\n\nThe user explicitly does NOT want training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking lists. The \"市场观察\" content type is exactly that - it shows training prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings. So I should exclude all \"市场观察\" candidates.\n\nAlso, the \"专题观察\" content type focuses on community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture - this is less about the actual technical implementation. The user wants database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles.\n\nThe most relevant content types for the user's interest would be:\n- 操作记录 (operation records - debugging, reproduction, fault handling)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles - implementation and principles)\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n\nLet me focus on these. The user cares about database, concurrency, and service fault handling.\n\nLet me identify the topics relevant:\n- Database: 慢查询, 组合索引, 连接池等待\n- Concurrency: 并发更新, 线程池排队, 任务取消\n- Service fault handling: 缓存失效, 接口幂等, 消息重复, 事务传播\n\nLet me select candidates that are 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览 types, avoiding 市场观察 and 专题观察.\n\nLet me count the available candidates of the good types. Let me go through the list.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The task says select 20 distinct candidates. Let me pick the best technical content.\n\nLet me identify all candidates that are NOT 市场观察 and NOT 专题观察 (since those are less aligned with the user's technical interest). Actually, let me reconsider 专题观察 - it's about community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture. This is somewhat tangential. The user wants implementation and principles of database, concurrency, fault handling.\n\nThe strongest matches are 操作记录 (fault handling/debugging), 条件与原理 (principles), and 概念速览 (concepts). Let me prioritize these.\n\nLet me list candidates by type:\n\n操作记录 (operation records - debugging/fault handling):\n- item-042e55d675a0: 缓存失效：社区服务中的操作记录\n- item-098771075993: 连接池等待：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n- item-0cf0da59e8f8: 接口幂等：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n- item-1ba5c7242ee5: 连接池等待：后台处理任务中的操作记录\n- item-1d6434c1a27f: 消息重复：消息消费者中的操作记录\n- item-326a31675f38: 接口幂等：后台处理任务中的操作记录\n- item-37ef339921da: 慢查询：消息消费者中的操作记录\n- item-38229375fac7: 任务取消：后台处理任务中的操作记录\n- item-3b4891c0e401: 组合索引：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n- item-45f8ac57ea42: 事务传播：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n- item-5160144d6193: 并发更新：社区服务中的操作记录\n- item-52cdcfdacb13: 任务取消：消息消费者中的操作记录\n- item-5462ffc0ac28: 慢查询：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n- item-5987d238b7de: 缓存失效：后台处理任务中的操作记录\n- item-5b1d60a35a47: 任务取消：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n- item-6ffb154f3fb5: 事务传播：消息消费者中的操作记录\n- item-80cbd1b167af: 并发更新：内容管理接口中的操作记录\n- item-379d2668d6db: 接口幂等：消息消费者中的操作记录\n\n条件与原理 (conditions and principles):\n- item-07ad7c7c66a5: 任务取消：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n- item-167782abe824: 事务传播：内容管理接口中的条件与原理\n- item-17c3bb0307b5: 并发更新：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n- item-20bfb5d44845: 连接池等待：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n- item-31156631e3f2: 接口幂等：社区服务中的条件与原理\n- item-3494031e73f0: 接口幂等：后台处理任务中的条件与原理\n- item-3a036e513cc4: 消息重复：消息消费者中的条件与原理\n- item-3b6e3